        "description": "A full-site editing block theme built for professional WordPress websites. Includes 20+ tested block patterns, 15+ niche style variations (medical, restaurant, agency, SaaS, legal, creative, and more), and 8 free one-click starter sites. Built-in SEO module with editable meta titles, descriptions, Schema.org, and Open Graph per page. Works beautifully as a standalone theme — pairs with the free Themecut plugin to generate complete AI-powered sites from a single sentence."
